{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system","id":1482425,"title":"Syndicate Illegal Operations Paradigm influence over Legal System","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-30T17:25:40-07:00","id":1482425,"title":"Syndicate Illegal Operations Paradigm influence over Legal System","content":"Capitalism is a game with winners and losers. Winners make it into the Walled Garden. Financiers and Enforcers who regulate organized crime from within its ranks, I think, would have worked to establish the rules of that game, historically speaking. There is a concept in law, called The <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dSDbl7_ygOw\" target=\"_blank\">Statute of Limitations</a>. It sets a time limit before which a suspect must be formally charged with a crime. In effect, it produces a kind of waiting game for those who live on the wrong side of the law. <br /> <br /> In your head-canon, would the Statute of Limitations have been worked into legal paradigms by Syndicate Mages?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T17:58:14-07:00","id":1482429,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m not sure. I never thought about this, though as an attorney I\u2019m familiar with the concept of Statute of Limitations. How would you interpret it in your head canon?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-30T21:59:50-07:00","id":1482461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482429#post1482429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m not sure. I never thought about this, though as an attorney I\u2019m familiar with the concept of Statute of Limitations. How would you interpret it in your head canon?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm happy to have you in the replies. I remember celebrating with a woman in my friend group when she was Called to the Bar. She had an immediate opportunity to join a fairly good firm, but wanted to find an inroad to a more powerful and well connected firm. The last time I saw her, she was quite hopeful, following a recent interview. I think she made it.<br /> <br /> White Wolf Wiki seems to emphasize the Renaissance as when the High Guild (a Syndicate precursor) really got rolling, despite having existed in some form long before. Wikipedia says that Classical Athens had a Statute of Limitations of five years for most crimes. In the case of Classical Athens, I would say the Syndicate has no claim to the establishment of the Statute, originally speaking. Sleepers or other Mage Philosophers could be credited with the idea.<br /> <br /> I think I broke the Internet trying to find out when the Statute of Limitations Act was first passed in the United States (if at all, because there are many individual statutes still being passed). <br /> <br /> When I think of the Syndicate's Illegal Operations, I think of two places; Sicily, Italy and New England, U.S.A., where the Mafia really spread its tendrils. Alcohol Prohibition ran from 1920 to 1933, during which time the Mafia made fortunes for its members. <br /> <br /> Before getting into the Syndicate's thinking regarding SoLs, these are the three listed reasons I came across.<ul><li>A plaintiff with a valid cause of action should pursue it with reasonable diligence.</li> <li>By the time a stale claim is litigated, a defendant might have lost evidence necessary to disprove the claim.</li> <li>Litigation of a long-dormant claim may result in more cruelty than justice</li> </ul><br /> I find the second of these to be the strongest argument in favor of limiting prosecutors' time to launch cases. I was playing video games on my old computer late at night. The next morning, someone informed me that a church in the neighborhood had burned down as a result of arson. I thought, at least my computer save files prove I was at home when the fire started. I would be rather pissed if I were pursued after that PC died. There's no actual chance of that happening. It's just a thought I had.<br /> <br /> Since Limitations on different types of cases in different States keep getting established, increased and decreased, I would say that the Syndicate occasionally uses it's influence to adjust the rules that affect Illegal Operations. Sleeper criminals are playing a capitalist game in which <i>laying low</i> for a prescribed timespan is a strategy presented for avoiding consequences - loss of revenue caused by time spent in prison. In much the same way Media Control decides what police drama plays at primetime, Enforcers and Underworld Financiers have an interest in deciding what lower level players in the criminal game get told as they're coming up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-31T15:10:58-07:00","id":1482544,"title":"","content":"Btw, <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>, do you know the history of introduction of Statute's of Limitation into American law?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T16:47:13-07:00","id":1482855,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482544#post1482544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Btw, <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>, do you know the history of introduction of Statute's of Limitation into American law?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don\u2019t, not really, but I do know that all fifty states and the federal government have numerous statutes of limitations for different crimes and torts (including breach of contract, which is not technically a tort).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-03T10:18:59-07:00","id":1482944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482544#post1482544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Btw, <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>, do you know the history of introduction of Statute's of Limitation into American law?</div> </div> </div> </div>Since always, it isn't an American institution. Statutes of Limitation exist at least since ancient Athens and have been common practice in civil and criminal law for an exceedingly long time, being present on the vast majority of countries for millennia. They're also far older than the Syndicate, or even the forefathers of the Order of Reason.<br /> <br /> Those rules exist to avoid a set of problems:<br /> <br /> 1 - <b>Abuse of Law</b>: Demosthenes wrote in the 4th century BC about professional accusers that motivated the creation of such laws in Athens, people that dig for dirt on others for profit. Some people do it for vengeance or other reasons not linked to the actual cause of litigation. This not being the purpose of law in the first place, Statutes of Limitations and Prescriptions are based on the notion that it is on the plaintiff to bring a valid complaint in due time, and after too much has passed it is more likely to be a tentative abuse of the law for personal gain;<br /> <br /> 2 - <b>Ease of Defense</b>: The passing of time tends to provoke a decay on evidence, making it harder or impossible to gather, but the initiator of a complaint has the greater likelihood of keeping the evidence of their interest against defense evidence. That way, waiting beyond reasonable time makes it harder for the defendant to prove innocence even if innocent;<br /> <br /> 3 - <b>Cruelty vs Justice</b>: Even in ancient time there was a notion that punishment a too long time after the facts loses relevance to the circumstances and becomes more cruel than brings justice. This became specially important as the criminal justice systems switched at least in theory to the Humanist notion of justice as an educative system to correct citizens instead of just avenge victims. This is a 18th century change, with far older seeds.<br /> <br /> While I understand the many ways such statutes are abused, and even above that how much outrage they can bring, they're actually far older and more relevant to the principles of Law than it seems at first. The Syndicate is likely to have influenced how they're applied in financial crimes, but not their mere existence and adoption world-wide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-03T22:02:20-07:00","id":1483013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482855#post1482855\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don\u2019t, not really, but I do know that all fifty states and the federal government have numerous statutes of limitations for different crimes and torts (including breach of contract, which is not technically a tort).</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, I feel better about not finding the answer with Google-Fu.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482944#post1482944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since always, it isn't an American institution. Statutes of Limitation exist at least since ancient Athens and have been common practice in civil and criminal law for an exceedingly long time, being present on the vast majority of countries for millennia. They're also far older than the Syndicate, or even the forefathers of the Order of Reason.</div> </div> </div> </div>A legal <i>tradition</i> then. Since the Traditions (mages) are described in the lore as having roots that go back to pre-history, I can imagine ships crossing the Mediterranean Ocean with the aide of weather-witches invested in the cargo.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482944#post1482944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those rules exist to avoid a set of problems:<br /> <br /> 1 - <b>Abuse of Law</b>: Demosthenes wrote in the 4th century BC about professional accusers that motivated the creation of such laws in Athens, people that dig for dirt on others for profit. Some people do it for vengeance or other reasons not linked to the actual cause of litigation. This not being the purpose of law in the first place, Statutes of Limitations and Prescriptions are based on the notion that it is on the plaintiff to bring a valid complaint in due time, and after too much has passed it is more likely to be a tentative abuse of the law for personal gain;</div> </div> </div> </div>I just listened to a reading of the speech Demosthenes gave when he stood trial. I saw a film reenactment of a part of his life some years ago. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482944#post1482944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2 - <b>Ease of Defense</b>: The passing of time tends to provoke a decay on evidence, making it harder or impossible to gather, but the initiator of a complaint has the greater likelihood of keeping the evidence of their interest against defense evidence. That way, waiting beyond reasonable time makes it harder for the defendant to prove innocence even if innocent;</div> </div> </div> </div>Today, the recollection of events by witnesses is probably the type of evidence that decays the most compared to physical evidence. In the 4th century BC, there wasn't a lot of high tech forensics. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482944#post1482944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3 - <b>Cruelty vs Justice</b>: Even in ancient time there was a notion that punishment a too long time after the facts loses relevance to the circumstances and becomes more cruel than brings justice. This became specially important as the criminal justice systems switched at least in theory to the Humanist notion of justice as an educative system to correct citizens instead of just avenge victims. This is a 18th century change, with far older seeds.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope we continue to go in the direction of Humanist Justice. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1482944#post1482944\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I understand the many ways such statutes are abused, and even above that how much outrage they can bring, they're actually far older and more relevant to the principles of Law than it seems at first. The Syndicate is likely to have influenced how they're applied in financial crimes, but not their mere existence and adoption world-wide.</div> </div> </div> </div>For embezzlement, Syndics in Legal Operations would want more time to go after the embezzler. For money laundering, Syndics in Illegal Operations would want to shorten the statutory window.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-03T22:21:57-07:00","id":1483015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483013#post1483013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A legal <i>tradition</i> then. Since the Traditions (mages) are described in the lore as having roots that go back to pre-history, I can imagine ships crossing the Mediterranean Ocean with the aide of weather-witches invested in the cargo.</div> </div> </div> </div>Certainly. It would be interesting to explore which Crafts through history delved into matters of Law, and how that evolved through the times.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483013#post1483013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Today, the recollection of events by witnesses is probably the type of evidence that decays the most compared to physical evidence. In the 4th century BC, there wasn't a lot of high tech forensics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not so much, there are many aspects to it.<br /> <br /> For one, witnesses are still a big thing in many trials all over the world, including the US. Between convincing a judge or jury to pay attention to analysis of physical evidence, and it even being correctly presented, many trials are still defined mostly or solely on witnesses.<br /> <br /> And physical evidence can be contaminated, tampered with, improperly handled, the team doing the analysis may lack the tools for a more thorough investigation, it can lose important context to be understood, sometimes simply lost. Time still plays a big role, and with its passing it gets harder and harder to find and analyze evidence.<br /> <br /> Do not let TV specials fool you. High-tech forensics are a thing, but in practice they're far from simple to have at hand and use properly, and not always crack a cold case. The reality is still mostly low-tech even in the richest countries.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483013#post1483013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For embezzlement, Syndics in Legal Operations would want more time to go after the embezzler. For money laundering, Syndics in Illegal Operations would want to shorten the statutory window.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure, care to share your reasoning?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-04T15:54:30-07:00","id":1483080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483015#post1483015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Certainly. It would be interesting to explore which Crafts through history delved into matters of Law, and how that evolved through the times.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think there was overlap in previous editions between the Akashic Shi Ren and the Wu Lung. White Wolf Wiki still lists both as Akashic sub-groups, while M20 has a two page entry about the Wu Lung, who are a Craft in the Disparate Alliance. The reason I mention the Shi Ren is their legalistic approach to Mind and other magic - &quot;A contract was signed and you will fulfill your obligations.&quot;. Both the Shi Ren and Wu Lung are a background element for my story, where international trade agreements are concerned. <br /> <br /> I have the Kopa Loei and Polynesian History listed as a subjects of future research, as they will play a role in an upcoming chapter of my story. The actual warrior priests on which the Craft is based were demoted from the top of the social hierarchy by colonial powers. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483015#post1483015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not so much, there are many aspects to it.<br /> <br /> For one, witnesses are still a big thing in many trials all over the world, including the US. Between convincing a judge or jury to pay attention to analysis of physical evidence, and it even being correctly presented, many trials are still defined mostly or solely on witnesses.<br /> <br /> And physical evidence can be contaminated, tampered with, improperly handled, the team doing the analysis may lack the tools for a more thorough investigation, it can lose important context to be understood, sometimes simply lost. Time still plays a big role, and with its passing it gets harder and harder to find and analyze evidence.<br /> <br /> Do not let TV specials fool you. High-tech forensics are a thing, but in practice they're far from simple to have at hand and use properly, and not always crack a cold case. The reality is still mostly low-tech even in the richest countries.</div> </div> </div> </div>I only watch &quot;television&quot; when visiting family, though I did watch CSI when it was popular.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483015#post1483015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure, care to share your reasoning?</div> </div> </div> </div>If you were a Financier doing startups and had to hire executives to run them, the ability to go after anyone who might embezzle from your investment would be important. So, investor/majority shareholder might have Time Magic. The Ebezzler has high Arcana and avoided detection. Years have passed and the former want to pursue the later. The Statute of Limitations might affect who wins.<br /> <br /> In Illegal Operations, any crime that is related to or part of money laundering can have an individual Statute. Suppose you were Marty Byrde from <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0TJ6H8z3RGY\" target=\"_blank\">Ozark</a>, attending to that aspect of a cartel's longstanding business interests. Statutes would be important.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-04T20:14:53-07:00","id":1483097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483080#post1483080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think there was overlap in previous editions between the Akashic Shi Ren and the Wu Lung. White Wolf Wiki still lists both as Akashic sub-groups, while M20 has a two page entry about the Wu Lung, who are a Craft in the Disparate Alliance. The reason I mention the Shi Ren is their legalistic approach to Mind and other magic - &quot;A contract was signed and you will fulfill your obligations.&quot;. Both the Shi Ren and Wu Lung are a background element for my story, where international trade agreements are concerned.<br /> <br /> I have the Kopa Loei and Polynesian History listed as a subjects of future research, as they will play a role in an upcoming chapter of my story. The actual warrior priests on which the Craft is based were demoted from the top of the social hierarchy by colonial powers.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>When I said &quot;Crafts&quot;, I didn't meant just the groups that became currently know just as crafts, but all Magic groups through history, as they were all Crafts before coalitions like the Traditions existed.<br /> <br /> My curiosity here would be to have an idea of how the science of Law evolved in Mage through all societies. The problem with dealing just with specific modern Crafts is that they represent limited ethnic cultures instead of general philosophical questions.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483080#post1483080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I only watch &quot;television&quot; when visiting family, though I did watch CSI when it was popular.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>That goes besides the point. What's important is that contrary to the impression some well known cases leave, advanced technology has still a very limited use in the justice system and a far lower success rate than it seems. It is incredible, <i>when it works</i>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483080#post1483080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you were a Financier doing startups and had to hire executives to run them, the ability to go after anyone who might embezzle from your investment would be important. So, investor/majority shareholder might have Time Magic. The Ebezzler has high Arcana and avoided detection. Years have passed and the former want to pursue the later. The Statute of Limitations might affect who wins.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this is a very unlikely scenario.<br /> <br /> Statutes of limitations still cover years, and they pertain to Sleeper law. A Syndicate's Financier would either perceive an embezzler far before it expires or would be dealing with another Awakened, and in this case would bring the full force of the Union and, if relevant to the case, the Union's own justice system.<br /> <br /> The work of the Syndicate on Sleeper institutions like this would be geared either to ease their work against Sleeper or to promote their pawns between Sleepers. There are economic theories about corruption, and that a certain level of corruption is necessary, and on top of that the Syndicate may use embezzlement to shift money from their companies to the Union and the Convention, as they wouldn't want the paper trail of regular dividends.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483080#post1483080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In Illegal Operations, any crime that is related to or part of money laundering can have an individual Statute. Suppose you were Marty Byrde from <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0TJ6H8z3RGY\" target=\"_blank\">Ozark</a>, attending to that aspect of a cartel's longstanding business interests. Statutes would be important.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>Every crime is related to money laundering. At the bank I get to see investigations on money laundering from time to time. Still remember a case of a guy who did it through cold Gun Import certificates.<br /> <br /> Setting a lower time for the Statutes of Money Laundering itself would certainly in their interests, but other crimes are too broad for this.<br /> <br /> It makes more sense for the N.W.O. actually to have a hand on those laws. They can use that influence to negotiate the interests of other members of the Union and on top of that use them to push things out of the reach of Sleeper justice, either to escape it or to get to meet their enemies in person without justice getting in the way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-06T11:48:17-07:00","id":1483240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483097#post1483097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When I said &quot;Crafts&quot;, I didn't meant just the groups that became currently know just as crafts, but all Magic groups through history, as they were all Crafts before coalitions like the Traditions existed.<br /> <br /> My curiosity here would be to have an idea of how the science of Law evolved in Mage through all societies. The problem with dealing just with specific modern Crafts is that they represent limited ethnic cultures instead of general philosophical questions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's open it up, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1483239-tradition-forerunners-influence-over-legal-systems-the-world-over\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483097#post1483097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That goes besides the point. What's important is that contrary to the impression some well known cases leave, advanced technology has still a very limited use in the justice system and a far lower success rate than it seems. It is incredible, <i>when it works</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have seen in interrogation videos, a police technique where they try to &quot;Mystify&quot; their powers in the mind of the suspect. A serial rapist and murderer who was a Colonel in the Canadian Military was told by an interrogator that his colleague was a world renowned footwear impressionist. Based on this lie, the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bsLbDzkIy3A\" target=\"_blank\">suspect confessed</a>. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483097#post1483097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think this is a very unlikely scenario.<br /> <br /> Statutes of limitations still cover years, and they pertain to Sleeper law. A Syndicate's Financier would either perceive an embezzler far before it expires or would be dealing with another Awakened, and in this case would bring the full force of the Union and, if relevant to the case, the Union's own justice system.<br /> <br /> The work of the Syndicate on Sleeper institutions like this would be geared either to ease their work against Sleeper or to promote their pawns between Sleepers. There are economic theories about corruption, and that a certain level of corruption is necessary, and on top of that the Syndicate may use embezzlement to shift money from their companies to the Union and the Convention, as they wouldn't want the paper trail of regular dividends.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair point. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483097#post1483097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Every crime is related to money laundering. At the bank I get to see investigations on money laundering from time to time. Still remember a case of a guy who did it through cold Gun Import certificates.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good to know. My sister studied forensic accounting.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483097#post1483097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Setting a lower time for the Statutes of Money Laundering itself would certainly in their interests, but other crimes are too broad for this.<br /> <br /> It makes more sense for the N.W.O. actually to have a hand on those laws. They can use that influence to negotiate the interests of other members of the Union and on top of that use them to push things out of the reach of Sleeper justice, either to escape it or to get to meet their enemies in person without justice getting in the way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Operatives must have to deal with their own accumulated Dark Resonance from time to time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-06T12:21:16-07:00","id":1483242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483240#post1483240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have seen in interrogation videos, a police technique where they try to &quot;Mystify&quot; their powers in the mind of the suspect. A serial rapist and murderer who was a Colonel in the Canadian Military was told by an interrogator that his colleague was a world renowned footwear impressionist. Based on this lie, the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bsLbDzkIy3A\" target=\"_blank\">suspect confessed</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's one of many techniques police use to obtain confessions.<br /> <br /> But the problem with those techniques is that they're worthless to find the truth, they're just good to make you confess. Under pressure you'll confess anything. Most of those aren't new, either, they're effective but have been known or rediscovered for millennia.<br /> <br /> Getting actual relevant information to find relevant clues is far more useful, but unfortunately an inordinate amount of people is sent to prison just on a hunch an coerced confession every year. I'm not sure how it is in Canada, it is minor today here in Brazil because there are specific laws to invalidate any case held on confession alone, but I know that in the US this is a huge problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-06T14:00:25-07:00","id":1483251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1482425-syndicate-illegal-operations-paradigm-influence-over-legal-system?p=1483242#post1483242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's one of many techniques police use to obtain confessions.<br /> <br /> But the problem with those techniques is that they're worthless to find the truth, they're just good to make you confess. Under pressure you'll confess anything. Most of those aren't new, either, they're effective but have been known or rediscovered for millennia.<br /> <br /> Getting actual relevant information to find relevant clues is far more useful, but unfortunately an inordinate amount of people is sent to prison just on a hunch an coerced confession every year. I'm not sure how it is in Canada, it is minor today here in Brazil because there are specific laws to invalidate any case held on confession alone, but I know that in the US this is a huge problem.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree. It's some kind of combination of physical evidence, footage (not that I want to live under more surveillance), witness testimony and, most importantly, prosecutors who are not chasing wins to ascend in their careers - able to exercise discretion over whether or not to try the case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}